{"results":[{"id":"69f1f50b6a5e5d1ca31204bb","name":"LofyStealer: Malware targeting Minecraft players.","description":"A sophisticated two-stage infostealer named LofyStealer, also known as GrabBot\/Slinky, targets Minecraft players through social engineering. The malware comprises a 53.5MB Node.js-based loader disguised within legitimate libraries and a 1.4MB native C++ payload that executes directly in memory. It extracts cookies, passwords, tokens, credit cards, and IBANs from eight different browsers including Chrome, Edge, Brave, Opera GX, and Firefox. The loader uses GitHub Actions for automated compilation while the payload employs direct syscalls to bypass EDR detection. Data is compressed via PowerShell, Base64-encoded, and exfiltrated to a Brazilian-hosted C2 server at 24.152.36.241. The operation is attributed with high confidence to the Brazilian cybercrime group LofyGang, operating a Malware-as-a-Service platform with Free and Premium tiers through a web panel branded as LofyStealer Advanced C2 Platform V2.0.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-04-30T07:56:01.091000","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47.279000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"LofyGang","indicators":[{"id":4334022484,"indicator":"24.152.36.241","type":"IPv4","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:48","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":"2026-05-29T12:00:00","is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4334022485,"indicator":"d21a5d08b4614005c8fcd9d0068f0190","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:48","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4334022486,"indicator":"fb203c0ac030a97281960d7c28d86ebf","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:48","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4334022487,"indicator":"9b1264eb4ff5ee8f00b8b80341fb6917dc3d3148","type":"FileHash-SHA1","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:48","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4334022488,"indicator":"f9fe23f24d45eae418c60819c523a83ddba4ca50","type":"FileHash-SHA1","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:48","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4334022489,"indicator":"293006cec43c663ccff331795d662c3b73b4d7af5f8584e2899e286c672c9881","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:48","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4334022490,"indicator":"45d4040e76a0d357dd6e236e185aba2eb82420d78640bfd1f3dede32b33931f7","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:48","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null}],"tags":["browser data","infostealer","chromelevator","grabbot","node.js loader","credential theft","syscalls evasion","lofystealer","slinky","minecraft"],"targeted_countries":[],"malware_families":["LofyStealer","GrabBot","chromelevator"],"attack_ids":["T1560.001","T1132.001","T1539","T1082","T1106","T1005","T1140","T1055.003","T1036","T1497.003","T1555.003","T1057","T1041","T1059.001","T1562.001","T1055.012","T1027","T1012","T1518.001","T1071.001"],"references":["https:\/\/zenox.ai\/en\/lofystealer-malware-mirando-jogadores-de-minecraft"],"industries":[],"extract_source":[],"more_indicators":false},{"id":"69f1f50a5410ca637c84368c","name":"Analysis of Attack Activities Using SSH+TOR Tunnels to Achieve Covert Persistence","description":"APT-C-13 (Sandworm), also known as FROZENBARENTS, is a state-sponsored advanced persistent threat group conducting global cyber espionage operations. The organization recently deployed malicious campaigns using nested SSH and TOR tunnel infrastructure to establish covert remote access channels. Attackers distribute ZIP archives containing weaponized LNK files via spearphishing emails, which extract and execute payloads that create scheduled tasks disguised as legitimate software. The attack establishes dual-encrypted anonymous tunnels using obfs4 protocol to bypass deep packet inspection, while mapping sensitive ports (SMB\/445, RDP\/3389) to Onion domains for persistent backdoor access. The campaign leverages sophisticated anti-analysis techniques including sandbox detection, file disguise, and process masquerading to evade detection and maintain long-term unauthorized control over compromised systems for intelligence collection.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-04-30T07:52:48.066000","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:46.770000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"APT-C-13, Sandworm, FROZENBARENTS","indicators":[{"id":4187692064,"indicator":"2zrek3mkl72d5b6evpkx2rz2glzrltiorgblpfb2ttg6lacwlsdk4iqd.onion","type":"domain","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4190678424,"indicator":"3xl6xhboulyuez6fuydyhj7pdvkshzn4ogsmgwbb3ukrkvgi6bcwvfyd.onion","type":"domain","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4193821916,"indicator":"0a78005858bef767b39cfbbeb543a80dfde46807ee75594de77d3ddfe119e8b5","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4324083592,"indicator":"2156c270ffe8e4b23b67efed191b9737","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4329211790,"indicator":"975d8bdfec6b58ae9004d526fa9f852108026a9c","type":"FileHash-SHA1","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4329211795,"indicator":"e3mnde5uyuxjoztup6t3m7nykbicexbzra76ucligwgsaez65w63y2ad.onion","type":"domain","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4329211796,"indicator":"imnlyhj4mtmtesqrvf7c4ma6dkxeyxw3ae53w6fuz42spndg7zpat6qd.onion","type":"domain","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4329211797,"indicator":"kvk46su7d2qi6g4n43syp4zbsf2rihnc6ztj77qtc2ojvewjqvqilnqd.onion","type":"domain","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4329211798,"indicator":"nytiplwknkinobjaeb5tajjiglip3vtaccju6ta7d47u5u64ktrwhrqd.onion","type":"domain","created":"2026-04-29T12:09:47","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null}],"tags":["sandworm","obfs4","apt-c-13","spearphishing","ssh tunneling","persistence mechanism","tor network","scheduled tasks"],"targeted_countries":[],"malware_families":[],"attack_ids":["T1053.005","T1036.005","T1204.002","T1497.001","T1021.004","T1566.001","T1140","T1021.002","T1036.004","T1041","T1059.001","T1547.001","T1090.003","T1027","T1573.002","T1070.004","T1071.001","T1021.001","T1564.001","T1090.001"],"references":["https:\/\/www.360.cn\/n\/13005.html"],"industries":["Government","Defense","Energy"],"extract_source":[],"more_indicators":false},{"id":"69f25f09e5c3a33611f7cb16","name":"DDoS-for-Hire Operation Exposed: How an Operator's Debug Build Unraveled a Commercial Game-Server Botnet","description":"An exposed open directory on a Netherlands-hosted server revealed the complete operational toolkit of xlabs_v1, a Mirai-derived IoT botnet operated by an actor using the handle Tadashi. The operation provides DDoS-for-hire services specifically targeting game servers and Minecraft hosts through 21 distinct flood attack variants. The botnet exploits Android Debug Bridge (ADB) on TCP\/5555 to compromise over 4 million potentially vulnerable IoT devices including Android TV boxes, smart TVs, and routers. The operation features bandwidth profiling to price-tier infected devices, ChaCha20 string encryption with cryptographic weaknesses, and competitor-eradication routines. Infrastructure analysis consolidated the entire operation within a single bulletproof \/24 netblock in the Netherlands, with co-located cryptojacking infrastructure also identified.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2026-04-30T07:50:29.498000","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:01.411000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"Tadashi","indicators":[{"id":4136474718,"indicator":"176.65.139.134","type":"IPv4","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":"2026-05-29T19:00:00","is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4191870638,"indicator":"176.65.139.9","type":"IPv4","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":"2026-05-29T19:00:00","is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4201611254,"indicator":"176.65.139.44","type":"IPv4","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":"2026-05-29T19:00:00","is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4247246539,"indicator":"176.65.139.42","type":"IPv4","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":"2026-05-29T19:00:00","is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4294973364,"indicator":"f962cb443975065b91d4512a42a529a091726e1815be28ced0ebb9dff997931d","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4294973365,"indicator":"a03705fc225dbcec7e3c2f06a258afe81b5d88aaff1368d10dd6ba4f0932be7c","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4335268943,"indicator":"5c3468e3c7a535b74fa91927fb1572d8","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":4335268944,"indicator":"78774672884f8cd7593fced3c7d1faa4","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2026-04-29T19:42:02","content":"